{"word":"τροχαντήρ","uri":"trochantêr","senses":[{"word":"τροχαντήρ","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">τροχαντήρ,</span></span> <span class=\"gens\">ῆρος</span>\n(<span class=\"grec\">ὁ</span>)\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> organe <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> instrument pour courir, <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> trochanter, <span class=\"ital\">partie du fémur\noù s’attachent les muscles moteurs de la cuisse,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 56,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> roue, instrument de\nsupplice (<span class=\"ital\">cf.</span> <span class=\"grec\">τροχός</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Jos.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Macc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8, 12</span>.</div>\n<div class=\"etymor\"><span class=\"etiqetymor\">Étym.</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">τροχάω</span>.</div>\n"}]}